    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601300202/6013002020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……\r\nでもその前に、ひとついいか？　大事なことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6013002020050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……何かしら？",
